[ Watch on kissFlix.co ]

1
00:00:07,625 --> 00:00:09,025
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

2
00:01:36,825 --> 00:01:38,985
ADAPTED FROM THE EARLY SPRING ON JJWXC.NET
AUTHOR: GU NIANG BIE KU

3
00:01:55,105 --> 00:01:57,945
I've got three things to report.

4
00:01:59,505 --> 00:02:00,425
First,

5
00:02:01,145 --> 00:02:05,185
next week's denim promotion is canceled.

6
00:02:06,305 --> 00:02:08,105
The good news is
I've already collected their deposits.

7
00:02:09,265 --> 00:02:10,545
Second,

8
00:02:11,305 --> 00:02:13,785
about the overdue payment
you've been asking me to chase,

9
00:02:13,865 --> 00:02:15,745
they're asking for another two months.

10
00:02:16,505 --> 00:02:17,985
He's making excuses about being broke,

11
00:02:18,065 --> 00:02:18,945
saying

12
00:02:19,505 --> 00:02:21,585
he might have to pull his kid
out of kindergarten.

13
00:02:23,505 --> 00:02:24,825
Last thing,

14
00:02:25,345 --> 00:02:28,465
the sponsor for the ice sculpture event
is cutting the budget.

15
00:02:28,545 --> 00:02:30,025
They said that's all they can offer.

16
00:02:31,785 --> 00:02:33,225
Should we still do it?

17
00:02:36,905 --> 00:02:39,665
I know we need money
to expand into new markets.

18
00:02:47,065 --> 00:02:47,905
Let's do it.

19
00:02:49,145 --> 00:02:50,265
Something is better than nothing.

20
00:02:51,305 --> 00:02:52,145
Boss,

21
00:02:52,745 --> 00:02:53,985
keep your chin up.

22
00:02:55,985 --> 00:02:59,025
I don't have any good news,

23
00:02:59,105 --> 00:03:02,065
but I was the first one
to join this company.

24
00:03:02,145 --> 00:03:04,265
As long as this company exists,

25
00:03:04,345 --> 00:03:05,585
I'm not leaving.

26
00:03:06,385 --> 00:03:07,785
Even if I don't get paid.

27
00:03:08,825 --> 00:03:10,185
Just don't stress yourself out.

28
00:03:26,705 --> 00:03:28,065
Xing,

29
00:03:28,825 --> 00:03:30,265
how did it go

30
00:03:30,825 --> 00:03:32,945
with the bank?

31
00:03:33,785 --> 00:03:35,025
Yes, I want to take out a loan.

32
00:03:35,905 --> 00:03:39,025
Okay. I'll bring the property deed over.

33
00:03:39,105 --> 00:03:40,585
Okay. Thanks.

34
00:03:50,265 --> 00:03:51,265
Are you really selling it?

35
00:03:54,545 --> 00:03:55,585
Take it over.

36
00:04:06,225 --> 00:04:09,745
SHANG ZHITAO, WELCOME BACK TO BEIJING

37
00:04:15,225 --> 00:04:16,105
Mr. Li,

38
00:04:16,184 --> 00:04:19,345
is your company looking to expand?

39
00:04:21,384 --> 00:04:22,225
Mr. Guan,

40
00:04:23,185 --> 00:04:25,145
I'd like to recommend
a great business partner.

41
00:04:28,825 --> 00:04:30,865
Someone will contact you
to discuss the details.

42
00:04:30,945 --> 00:04:32,545
I gave them your number.

43
00:04:33,985 --> 00:04:35,385
Thank you so much, Mr. Luan.

44
00:04:36,025 --> 00:04:37,825
You helped us out a lot

45
00:04:37,905 --> 00:04:39,745
when we needed it most.

46
00:04:40,345 --> 00:04:41,385
I'll be sure to tell Boss.

47
00:04:42,385 --> 00:04:43,345
No.

48
00:04:43,425 --> 00:04:44,465
Don't tell her.

49
00:04:45,225 --> 00:04:47,505
Whether it works or not
depends on Ms. Shang's negotiation skills.

50
00:04:47,585 --> 00:04:49,185
I'm just making the introduction.

51
00:04:49,265 --> 00:04:50,625
I can't decide the outcome.

52
00:04:51,785 --> 00:04:52,745
One more thing.

53
00:04:52,825 --> 00:04:54,145
Send me your office address.

54
00:04:54,785 --> 00:04:56,505
I bought two down jackets to send over.

55
00:04:57,025 --> 00:04:57,985
Pass them to her.

56
00:04:58,065 --> 00:04:59,505
Sure. Thank you, Mr. Luan.

57
00:05:11,985 --> 00:05:16,345
BEIJING TO HARBIN FLIGHT BOOKING PAGE

58
00:05:19,265 --> 00:05:21,985
COMPLETE YOUR BOOKING: BEIJING TO HARBIN

59
00:05:49,465 --> 00:05:50,385
Shang Zhitao.

60
00:05:56,305 --> 00:05:57,345
What's wrong?

61
00:06:01,345 --> 00:06:03,065
I mortgaged my apartment.

62
00:06:03,145 --> 00:06:04,305
I'm just

63
00:06:05,905 --> 00:06:07,185
feeling a little down.

64
00:06:14,505 --> 00:06:15,625
Why did you mortgage your apartment?

65
00:06:16,585 --> 00:06:18,865
The company is barely staying afloat.

66
00:06:20,705 --> 00:06:21,705
Everything costs money.

67
00:06:21,785 --> 00:06:23,625
I'm still waiting to collect 100,000 yuan.

68
00:06:26,985 --> 00:06:28,505
If you need it,

69
00:06:28,585 --> 00:06:29,505
I can help you out.

70
00:06:35,865 --> 00:06:37,665
Luan Nian, you're trying to help,

71
00:06:38,345 --> 00:06:40,705
but I don't need it.

72
00:06:40,785 --> 00:06:42,745
I've figured something out.

73
00:06:42,825 --> 00:06:45,265
I sold the car

74
00:06:45,345 --> 00:06:46,425
and mortgaged the house.

75
00:06:46,505 --> 00:06:48,225
I still have some savings.

76
00:06:49,105 --> 00:06:50,905
You know me. I want to make it on my own.

77
00:06:56,265 --> 00:06:57,665
Why are you here?

78
00:06:59,985 --> 00:07:00,865
I'm here to apply.

79
00:07:02,545 --> 00:07:03,505
For what?

80
00:07:04,345 --> 00:07:05,505
Driver, assistant,

81
00:07:06,025 --> 00:07:07,265
or boyfriend.

82
00:07:07,345 --> 00:07:08,225
I'm fine with any of them.

83
00:07:11,225 --> 00:07:12,105
You're not suitable.

84
00:07:12,185 --> 00:07:14,545
-How am I not?
-In every way.

85
00:07:16,865 --> 00:07:18,065
Ms. Shang,

86
00:07:19,185 --> 00:07:20,225
give me a chance.

87
00:07:22,385 --> 00:07:23,305
Mr. Luan,

88
00:07:23,385 --> 00:07:25,065
this is a startup.

89
00:07:25,585 --> 00:07:27,865
We're too small for someone like you.

90
00:07:29,385 --> 00:07:30,665
I don't charge much.

91
00:07:32,345 --> 00:07:33,745
Even if we're hiring,

92
00:07:33,825 --> 00:07:35,065
we need someone local,

93
00:07:35,625 --> 00:07:37,105
who can stay long-term.

94
00:07:37,905 --> 00:07:38,905
If you're okay with it,

95
00:07:38,985 --> 00:07:40,145
I can move here.

96
00:07:43,545 --> 00:07:44,585
That's not necessary.

97
00:07:45,105 --> 00:07:47,745
My next step is expanding
into digital advertising.

98
00:07:48,345 --> 00:07:50,105
It's a completely new business.

99
00:07:50,185 --> 00:07:52,865
The execution and expertise required
aren't your strengths.

100
00:07:53,545 --> 00:07:55,505
Do you still think
you're the right fit, Mr. Luan?

101
00:07:55,585 --> 00:07:57,385
If you hire someone local,

102
00:07:57,905 --> 00:08:00,585
training and integrating them
will take at least six months.

103
00:08:01,785 --> 00:08:03,465
If you trust my abilities,

104
00:08:04,065 --> 00:08:06,025
I'll work for free
for the first six months.

105
00:08:08,185 --> 00:08:09,105
Mr. Luan,

106
00:08:10,185 --> 00:08:12,145
does Lime know what you're doing?

107
00:08:12,225 --> 00:08:13,385
Doesn't matter.

108
00:08:24,185 --> 00:08:25,025
Be my driver then.

109
00:08:31,105 --> 00:08:32,025
Coming.

110
00:08:41,264 --> 00:08:42,345
DISINFECTANT SPRAY

111
00:08:50,985 --> 00:08:52,105
HOURS: 9:30 A.M. - 10:00 P.M.
OLD COUPLE'S TAVERN

112
00:08:52,185 --> 00:08:53,105
Mr. and Mrs. Shang,

113
00:08:53,185 --> 00:08:56,145
I brought you some Beijing specialties
and some health supplements.

114
00:09:02,385 --> 00:09:03,225
Why are you here again?

115
00:09:04,185 --> 00:09:05,185
Luke.

116
00:09:36,225 --> 00:09:37,105
Luan Nian,

117
00:09:37,625 --> 00:09:39,345
Luke doesn't look well.

118
00:09:59,745 --> 00:10:02,185
Don't worry. I told you
I'd help take care of Luke.

119
00:10:07,505 --> 00:10:10,385
MEAT PATTY

120
00:10:12,745 --> 00:10:13,905
Your new business
is finally on the right track.

121
00:10:14,505 --> 00:10:17,505
Now I get to have a proper drink
with a rising young entrepreneur.

122
00:10:18,025 --> 00:10:19,345
So?

123
00:10:19,865 --> 00:10:21,985
Did Luke manage to wait for you

124
00:10:22,505 --> 00:10:23,905
out there in the freezing cold that day?

125
00:10:27,505 --> 00:10:28,905
He's not young anymore.

126
00:10:28,985 --> 00:10:30,425
Weren't you afraid he'd freeze to death?

127
00:10:31,865 --> 00:10:32,865
Lumi.

128
00:10:34,665 --> 00:10:36,065
After all these years,

129
00:10:36,145 --> 00:10:39,025
I still owe you an apology.

130
00:10:39,105 --> 00:10:40,145
I was keeping it from you.

131
00:10:40,225 --> 00:10:42,185
Stop. Do you really think
I'm that clueless?

132
00:10:42,265 --> 00:10:44,185
I knew something was up.

133
00:10:45,545 --> 00:10:47,545
Back when you first graduated,
you were so sweet

134
00:10:47,625 --> 00:10:49,465
and innocent.

135
00:10:49,545 --> 00:10:52,265
Every time you saw him,
your face turned bright red.

136
00:10:52,345 --> 00:10:53,985
The funniest one
was that time in the elevator.

137
00:10:54,065 --> 00:10:55,905
I wondered what you two were up to,

138
00:10:55,985 --> 00:10:56,905
so I snuck a peek.

139
00:10:57,425 --> 00:10:58,545
The way you looked at him.

140
00:11:01,705 --> 00:11:03,225
There was one time when it was obvious.

141
00:11:03,305 --> 00:11:04,785
I knew right then.

142
00:11:05,465 --> 00:11:06,425
When?

143
00:11:07,425 --> 00:11:08,545
The shady agency gave you trouble.

144
00:11:10,145 --> 00:11:11,505
Luke stepped in to help.

145
00:11:12,025 --> 00:11:13,105
That's when I knew.

146
00:11:13,185 --> 00:11:14,025
Everything clicked.

147
00:11:14,105 --> 00:11:15,905
These two are definitely
more than colleagues.

148
00:11:17,105 --> 00:11:18,265
Looking back,

149
00:11:18,785 --> 00:11:20,345
it really was obvious.

150
00:11:20,425 --> 00:11:21,625
Way too obvious.

151
00:11:21,705 --> 00:11:23,545
Keeping up the act was exhausting.

152
00:11:24,145 --> 00:11:24,985
Cheers.

153
00:11:30,705 --> 00:11:31,585
Tao.

154
00:11:32,705 --> 00:11:34,105
How's Luan Nian treating you?

155
00:11:35,665 --> 00:11:37,025
What do you mean?

156
00:11:38,705 --> 00:11:39,905
In every way.

157
00:11:39,985 --> 00:11:40,985
How does he treat you?

158
00:11:45,425 --> 00:11:46,265
Pretty well.

159
00:11:47,665 --> 00:11:50,385
So he's the whole package?

160
00:11:52,145 --> 00:11:52,985
‎I…

161
00:11:53,065 --> 00:11:54,585
He's alright.

162
00:11:54,665 --> 00:11:55,865
What about you?

163
00:11:55,945 --> 00:11:57,425
How are things with Will?

164
00:11:57,505 --> 00:11:58,745
Getting married soon?

165
00:12:01,865 --> 00:12:03,265
Well.

166
00:12:03,785 --> 00:12:05,145
He's pretty old-fashioned.

167
00:12:05,225 --> 00:12:07,065
His whole family is.

168
00:12:07,145 --> 00:12:08,665
Also,

169
00:12:09,825 --> 00:12:11,265
I don't think they like me much.

170
00:12:12,545 --> 00:12:14,505
How could they not like you?

171
00:12:15,385 --> 00:12:17,065
I'm a millionaire
from demolition compensation.

172
00:12:17,145 --> 00:12:19,185
What's wrong with that?

173
00:12:19,265 --> 00:12:21,105
Who wouldn't like that?

174
00:12:27,585 --> 00:12:29,585
Are you really not giving
Luan Nian another chance?

175
00:12:31,385 --> 00:12:32,665
Why are we talking about me again?

176
00:12:43,745 --> 00:12:44,585
I'll finish it.

177
00:12:48,545 --> 00:12:50,785
You're in your element
when you're back in the Northeast.

178
00:12:51,585 --> 00:12:53,425
Come on, finish your drink.
Don't say that.

179
00:12:53,505 --> 00:12:57,145
MEAT PATTY

180
00:12:57,225 --> 00:12:58,345
Ms. Shang,

181
00:12:58,425 --> 00:12:59,985
I sent you a video.

182
00:13:00,065 --> 00:13:01,145
Take a look.

183
00:13:02,105 --> 00:13:03,225
Shang Zhitao,

184
00:13:04,825 --> 00:13:05,985
do you remember?

185
00:13:06,865 --> 00:13:08,425
We promised we'd watch
the aurora together.

186
00:13:09,785 --> 00:13:11,145
But you disappeared.

187
00:13:14,145 --> 00:13:15,665
You have to see them.

188
00:13:16,345 --> 00:13:17,905
They're beautiful.

189
00:13:23,265 --> 00:13:24,105
I'm sorry.

190
00:13:28,625 --> 00:13:29,905
I really am sorry.

191
00:13:30,825 --> 00:13:32,425
I know I'm a mess.

192
00:13:33,465 --> 00:13:34,705
I don't deserve to be loved.

193
00:13:38,025 --> 00:13:39,745
I just wanted to tell you…

194
00:13:45,105 --> 00:13:46,185
I miss you.

195
00:13:48,025 --> 00:13:49,305
I miss you so much.

196
00:13:52,385 --> 00:13:53,665
I love you.

197
00:13:54,945 --> 00:13:56,545
I love you.

198
00:14:11,505 --> 00:14:12,985
Luan Nian doesn't know
I recorded this video

199
00:14:13,065 --> 00:14:14,465
or have sent it to you.

200
00:14:17,865 --> 00:14:19,545
I sent you this video

201
00:14:19,625 --> 00:14:20,825
because I wanted you to know

202
00:14:21,745 --> 00:14:23,105
he really loves you.

203
00:14:23,185 --> 00:14:24,945
If you love him too,

204
00:14:25,465 --> 00:14:26,985
don't let him go so easily.

205
00:14:43,545 --> 00:14:44,545
Don't worry.

206
00:14:45,305 --> 00:14:47,545
Luke just needs two more days of IVs.

207
00:14:48,065 --> 00:14:49,305
He'll be back
to his energetic self in no time.

208
00:14:51,225 --> 00:14:52,185
Luan Nian,

209
00:14:53,785 --> 00:14:54,785
thank you.

210
00:15:27,505 --> 00:15:28,865
Actually, I regret

211
00:15:29,785 --> 00:15:31,585
not hugging you

212
00:15:32,905 --> 00:15:34,145
or comforting you

213
00:15:34,945 --> 00:15:35,865
when you took Luke away last time.

214
00:16:42,785 --> 00:16:45,185
If it weren't because I wanted to prove
I wanted to be with you forever,

215
00:16:46,625 --> 00:16:47,505
I'd have made you pay

216
00:16:50,025 --> 00:16:51,865
for it today.

217
00:16:55,345 --> 00:16:56,705
My flight back to Beijing is tomorrow.

218
00:16:57,225 --> 00:16:58,465
Mind if I stay tonight?

219
00:17:05,545 --> 00:17:06,424
Shang Zhitao,

220
00:17:07,305 --> 00:17:08,184
I'm sorry.

221
00:17:10,345 --> 00:17:11,224
For everything that happened.

222
00:17:13,585 --> 00:17:15,224
I truly loved you.

223
00:17:17,265 --> 00:17:18,665
I'm sure you could tell.

224
00:17:18,745 --> 00:17:21,345
DISINFECTANT SPRAY

225
00:17:26,025 --> 00:17:27,145
We've still got a long road ahead.

226
00:17:28,625 --> 00:17:29,745
I'll take it one step at a time.

227
00:17:39,305 --> 00:17:40,185
You…

228
00:17:41,145 --> 00:17:42,185
I'll sleep in the guest room.

229
00:18:18,305 --> 00:18:19,345
Can't sleep?

230
00:18:28,385 --> 00:18:29,305
Let me help.

231
00:18:42,825 --> 00:18:43,985
I can't sleep either.

232
00:18:47,425 --> 00:18:48,265
Luan Nian.

233
00:19:07,585 --> 00:19:08,985
If you don't want this,

234
00:19:09,865 --> 00:19:11,465
I'll stop right now.

235
00:21:14,905 --> 00:21:16,225
She's probably fine.

236
00:21:16,305 --> 00:21:18,585
She hasn't answered her phone.
I'll go check on her.

237
00:21:21,225 --> 00:21:22,265
Luan Nian.

238
00:21:23,865 --> 00:21:25,185
Is she out cold?

239
00:21:25,265 --> 00:21:26,225
Dad.

240
00:21:27,425 --> 00:21:28,265
I…

241
00:21:28,985 --> 00:21:30,025
I was exhausted yesterday.

242
00:21:30,105 --> 00:21:30,945
I didn't hear the phone.

243
00:21:31,025 --> 00:21:32,785
Don't worry. Go back first.

244
00:21:32,865 --> 00:21:34,625
I'll clean up and get up soon.

245
00:21:35,225 --> 00:21:36,065
Alright.

246
00:21:36,865 --> 00:21:37,705
Mr. Shang.

247
00:21:48,305 --> 00:21:49,345
You're here.

248
00:21:55,225 --> 00:21:58,225
You two aren't wearing enough.

249
00:22:00,625 --> 00:22:01,785
Come upstairs now.

250
00:22:10,865 --> 00:22:11,985
Mr. and Mrs. Shang,

251
00:22:12,745 --> 00:22:14,185
I'll take responsibility for Tao.

252
00:22:21,305 --> 00:22:23,065
What's going on here?

253
00:22:23,145 --> 00:22:24,145
Explain yourselves.

254
00:22:27,985 --> 00:22:28,905
Well…

255
00:22:28,985 --> 00:22:30,105
Keep quiet.

256
00:22:34,505 --> 00:22:35,585
You talk.

257
00:22:37,305 --> 00:22:38,305
Here's the truth.

258
00:22:40,025 --> 00:22:41,945
I'm sure you already know

259
00:22:42,025 --> 00:22:43,265
about what happened between Tao and me.

260
00:22:44,385 --> 00:22:46,825
We were together for six years.

261
00:22:47,585 --> 00:22:49,465
Because of some misunderstandings,

262
00:22:50,585 --> 00:22:51,625
she broke up with me.

263
00:22:54,505 --> 00:22:55,985
But when we met again this time,

264
00:22:56,585 --> 00:22:58,945
we realized we still
had feelings for each other.

265
00:23:00,705 --> 00:23:02,025
That's basically it.

266
00:23:06,265 --> 00:23:08,545
You're not even married,
yet you're already living together.

267
00:23:08,625 --> 00:23:10,305
That's no way to behave.

268
00:23:10,905 --> 00:23:12,505
How could you be so foolish, Tao?

269
00:23:13,465 --> 00:23:14,505
We can get married.

270
00:23:15,425 --> 00:23:16,465
I'm ready anytime.

271
00:23:24,345 --> 00:23:25,385
I'm just waiting for Tao's answer.

272
00:23:33,505 --> 00:23:35,705
I mean it. Mr. and Mrs. Shang,

273
00:23:37,145 --> 00:23:39,425
I know a woman's reputation matters.

274
00:23:39,945 --> 00:23:41,105
I'll take responsibility.

275
00:23:51,825 --> 00:23:53,145
You heard him.

276
00:23:53,705 --> 00:23:55,145
Why are we still sitting here?

277
00:23:56,065 --> 00:23:58,585
He wants to marry her.
Let them talk it over.

278
00:23:58,665 --> 00:23:59,505
Let's leave.

279
00:24:01,745 --> 00:24:03,305
Tao, put on more clothes.
Don't catch a cold.

280
00:24:05,505 --> 00:24:06,425
You two talk it over.

281
00:24:06,505 --> 00:24:07,705
We'll come back later.

282
00:24:28,385 --> 00:24:29,825
What's wrong, Flora?

283
00:24:32,625 --> 00:24:33,505
What did you call me?

284
00:24:35,785 --> 00:24:36,745
My dear wife.

285
00:24:41,865 --> 00:24:42,985
I was telling the truth.

286
00:24:43,505 --> 00:24:45,345
If we hadn't broken up,

287
00:24:45,865 --> 00:24:47,465
we'd already be married.

288
00:24:49,865 --> 00:24:52,105
If we hadn't broken up,

289
00:24:53,345 --> 00:24:54,705
our kid would probably be grown up by now.

290
00:24:57,105 --> 00:24:58,665
You really just say
whatever comes to mind.

291
00:24:59,265 --> 00:25:00,105
Can you really take responsibility?

292
00:25:00,185 --> 00:25:01,265
I can.

293
00:25:05,985 --> 00:25:07,185
I mean every word.

294
00:25:10,425 --> 00:25:12,385
Back then, I thought
I'd planned everything perfectly.

295
00:25:13,545 --> 00:25:14,985
I'd spend six months in the US,

296
00:25:15,625 --> 00:25:18,065
then come back, and you'd receive
the Specialist title you deserved.

297
00:25:24,345 --> 00:25:25,185
Tao.

298
00:25:27,025 --> 00:25:28,385
I want to spend
the rest of my life with you.

299
00:25:43,225 --> 00:25:45,145
The Beijing branch has just opened.

300
00:25:45,225 --> 00:25:47,865
From now on, I'll be splitting my time
between Harbin and Beijing.

301
00:25:48,945 --> 00:25:50,785
2021, BEIJING

302
00:25:54,785 --> 00:25:55,945
Luke,

303
00:25:56,025 --> 00:25:56,985
we're going back to Beijing.

304
00:25:59,425 --> 00:26:00,785
Luke.

305
00:26:06,585 --> 00:26:08,265
I got praised at the summit.

306
00:26:08,785 --> 00:26:09,985
Ms. Shang Zhitao.

307
00:26:10,065 --> 00:26:11,945
We'd like to invite you back to Lime

308
00:26:12,025 --> 00:26:14,425
to share your experience
as one of our event partners.

309
00:26:19,025 --> 00:26:19,865
Sure.

310
00:26:22,785 --> 00:26:23,745
Shang Zhitao,

311
00:26:24,345 --> 00:26:25,585
welcome back to Beijing.

312
00:26:43,185 --> 00:26:44,345
Shang Zhitao.

313
00:26:46,065 --> 00:26:48,465
Flora is like a different person now.

314
00:26:50,305 --> 00:26:51,745
It's New Year's Eve.

315
00:26:51,825 --> 00:26:52,825
Don't stay out too late.

316
00:26:53,625 --> 00:26:54,625
Happy New Year in advance, everyone.

317
00:26:54,705 --> 00:26:57,105
Happy New Year.

318
00:26:57,745 --> 00:26:58,785
Flora.

319
00:27:00,345 --> 00:27:01,865
Let's grab a meal sometime.

320
00:27:01,945 --> 00:27:02,785
As friends.

321
00:27:04,465 --> 00:27:06,185
We'll talk about dinner another time.

322
00:27:06,745 --> 00:27:08,225
We're supposed to go
grocery shopping together.

323
00:27:11,505 --> 00:27:12,625
Flora, I have to ask.

324
00:27:12,705 --> 00:27:15,425
How did you ever put up with his temper?

325
00:27:16,305 --> 00:27:18,465
Are you seriously gaslighting
my wife in front of me?

326
00:27:27,665 --> 00:27:29,065
We're heading out. Bye.

327
00:27:29,145 --> 00:27:30,585
-Bye.
-Bye.

328
00:27:39,065 --> 00:27:40,265
What's wrong?

329
00:27:40,345 --> 00:27:41,185
What time will you be back?

330
00:27:41,265 --> 00:27:43,065
We're going shopping
for Chinese New Year's supplies together.

331
00:27:43,945 --> 00:27:45,185
I still have something to do.

332
00:27:45,265 --> 00:27:46,105
I'll be back later.

333
00:27:50,745 --> 00:27:51,625
Also,

334
00:27:52,865 --> 00:27:54,305
I might be bringing someone home.

335
00:28:10,865 --> 00:28:12,145
Where are we going?

336
00:28:13,985 --> 00:28:14,865
Come with me.

337
00:28:32,465 --> 00:28:34,465
Welcome to Flora's Museum
of Time &amp; Eternity.

338
00:28:35,225 --> 00:28:37,185
I'm your personal tour guide,

339
00:28:38,425 --> 00:28:39,265
Luan Nian.

340
00:29:07,665 --> 00:29:08,945
This is Shang Zhitao in 2012,

341
00:29:09,025 --> 00:29:10,665
when she first arrived in Beijing.

342
00:29:14,345 --> 00:29:18,545
She was terrified but also curious
about this unfamiliar city.

343
00:29:19,465 --> 00:29:21,065
She treated everything with awe.

344
00:29:23,945 --> 00:29:27,105
She devoted all of her time to work.

345
00:29:29,865 --> 00:29:33,585
Unfortunately, she wound up with a boss
who tried to make her quit every day.

346
00:29:34,825 --> 00:29:36,585
That boss was a real jerk.

347
00:29:40,985 --> 00:29:42,305
Luckily,

348
00:29:42,385 --> 00:29:45,025
I happened to run into my boss that night.

349
00:29:45,105 --> 00:29:46,305
He drove me home.

350
00:29:51,865 --> 00:29:52,745
Do you know something?

351
00:29:53,785 --> 00:29:55,465
The first time I drove you home,

352
00:29:55,985 --> 00:29:56,825
it wasn't on my way.

353
00:30:00,985 --> 00:30:02,425
It never was.

354
00:30:03,345 --> 00:30:04,945
I took the long way
because I wanted to drive you home.

355
00:30:06,705 --> 00:30:07,545
Get in.

356
00:30:17,785 --> 00:30:19,025
MAKE EVERY DAY COUNT

357
00:30:19,105 --> 00:30:20,345
WISHING YOU ALL THE BEST
AS YOU KEEP GROWING

358
00:30:20,425 --> 00:30:21,665
ANONYMOUS

359
00:30:38,945 --> 00:30:40,505
Shang Zhitao, you were brave back then.

360
00:30:42,385 --> 00:30:44,025
I went there to save you.

361
00:30:44,585 --> 00:30:47,065
But in the end,
you were the one who saved me.

362
00:30:59,305 --> 00:31:00,225
Shang Zhitao.

363
00:31:01,265 --> 00:31:02,185
There's something I need to say.

364
00:31:05,945 --> 00:31:07,545
About the handbag.

365
00:31:09,465 --> 00:31:10,785
My mother loves handbags,

366
00:31:12,385 --> 00:31:14,185
so I mistakenly assumed

367
00:31:14,265 --> 00:31:16,105
every woman did too.

368
00:31:17,545 --> 00:31:19,225
When I gave it to you,

369
00:31:20,465 --> 00:31:21,985
I just wanted to give you the best,

370
00:31:27,025 --> 00:31:29,305
but I simply didn't know how to express
how much I cared about you.

371
00:31:31,105 --> 00:31:32,625
I'm sorry

372
00:31:32,705 --> 00:31:33,545
I made you uncomfortable.

373
00:31:37,585 --> 00:31:39,185
Your old bag was worn out.

374
00:31:39,265 --> 00:31:40,545
Have a new one.

375
00:31:45,305 --> 00:31:46,265
It's okay.

376
00:31:56,305 --> 00:31:58,305
I remember you complimented me.

377
00:32:00,025 --> 00:32:01,265
You hired a great employee.

378
00:32:01,785 --> 00:32:03,345
She turned my impossible
into a possibility.

379
00:32:03,865 --> 00:32:06,345
The prototype of the database
you've all seen

380
00:32:06,425 --> 00:32:08,465
was led

381
00:32:08,545 --> 00:32:10,745
by our new teammate, Flora.

382
00:32:12,865 --> 00:32:14,665
I just wanted everyone to know

383
00:32:15,185 --> 00:32:16,785
that you'd accomplished something amazing.

384
00:32:17,545 --> 00:32:18,545
I was proud of you.

385
00:32:37,145 --> 00:32:39,185
These are the flowers Sun Yuanzhu gave me.

386
00:32:40,105 --> 00:32:40,945
Yes.

387
00:32:43,505 --> 00:32:45,105
Actually, they suited you perfectly.

388
00:32:46,105 --> 00:32:47,865
I lied because I was jealous.

389
00:32:51,665 --> 00:32:52,865
Sun Yuanzhu was a wonderful person.

390
00:32:53,905 --> 00:32:55,105
I should've thanked him.

391
00:33:07,105 --> 00:33:08,625
Just call me Luan Nian.

392
00:33:09,905 --> 00:33:10,785
Luan Nian.

393
00:33:20,025 --> 00:33:22,025
The boss had already
fallen in love with her.

394
00:33:23,545 --> 00:33:24,945
He just didn't realize it yet.

395
00:33:25,705 --> 00:33:28,305
He was the first one
to fall for Shang Zhitao.

396
00:33:33,425 --> 00:33:35,065
You can control your feelings for someone.

397
00:33:37,905 --> 00:33:39,025
If you mind,

398
00:33:39,105 --> 00:33:40,945
we can keep our relationship a secret.

399
00:33:41,905 --> 00:33:43,785
Encourage you. Praise you more.

400
00:33:43,865 --> 00:33:44,825
I'll remember that.

401
00:33:46,265 --> 00:33:47,225
We promised

402
00:33:47,825 --> 00:33:49,065
to be honest with each other.

403
00:33:51,545 --> 00:33:52,745
I'm not good with sweet words,

404
00:33:53,385 --> 00:33:54,545
but I miss you.

405
00:33:55,105 --> 00:33:56,185
I want to see you.

406
00:34:00,145 --> 00:34:01,705
He couldn't express himself.

407
00:34:01,785 --> 00:34:02,825
He didn't know how to love.

408
00:34:03,985 --> 00:34:05,225
He lacked empathy.

409
00:34:06,705 --> 00:34:07,785
He once got into a fight.

410
00:34:08,985 --> 00:34:10,025
He pretended to be sick.

411
00:34:14,465 --> 00:34:15,744
And for Shang Zhitao,

412
00:34:16,344 --> 00:34:17,465
he traveled across

413
00:34:17,985 --> 00:34:19,465
many cities

414
00:34:20,545 --> 00:34:21,545
just to see her.

415
00:34:22,625 --> 00:34:23,824
Quietly.

416
00:34:49,905 --> 00:34:51,025
DAD, SHANG ZHITAO, MOM
WE'LL STAY WITH YOU ALWAYS

417
00:34:51,105 --> 00:34:53,585
These are little Tao's handprints
and footprints from when she was born.

418
00:34:54,625 --> 00:34:57,465
These were her tiny shoes and mittens.

419
00:34:57,985 --> 00:34:59,385
And this was her favorite Walkman.

420
00:35:01,505 --> 00:35:02,945
You worked hard last night.

421
00:35:05,265 --> 00:35:06,905
Actually, he is

422
00:35:07,785 --> 00:35:09,025
a bit lonely.

423
00:35:09,545 --> 00:35:12,105
He has a big fish tank at home,

424
00:35:12,745 --> 00:35:14,585
but there's only one fish in it.

425
00:35:22,985 --> 00:35:26,465
SHANG ZHITAO'S BUCKET LIST
BEFORE TURNING 30

426
00:35:29,105 --> 00:35:29,945
It's

427
00:35:31,305 --> 00:35:33,105
my bucket list.

428
00:35:47,065 --> 00:35:49,705
SHANG ZHITAO'S BUCKET LIST
BEFORE TURNING 30

429
00:35:52,625 --> 00:35:57,385
SHANG ZHITAO'S BUCKET LIST
BEFORE TURNING 30

430
00:35:59,305 --> 00:36:00,465
Shang Zhitao.

431
00:36:02,505 --> 00:36:03,825
I really regret

432
00:36:05,505 --> 00:36:07,265
what I said to you.

433
00:36:09,185 --> 00:36:10,465
I've never thought about any of this.

434
00:36:11,985 --> 00:36:13,425
And I don't have a bucket list.

435
00:36:19,705 --> 00:36:20,625
From now on,

436
00:36:20,705 --> 00:36:23,225
I want to be part
of every item on your bucket list.

437
00:36:24,745 --> 00:36:25,865
Today, I want

438
00:36:27,745 --> 00:36:28,905
to build a dream for you.

439
00:36:33,385 --> 00:36:34,905
This museum

440
00:36:35,905 --> 00:36:37,785
holds so much of your past.

441
00:36:38,985 --> 00:36:40,585
It also holds our future.

442
00:36:55,065 --> 00:36:56,665
Ms. Shang Zhitao,

443
00:36:58,265 --> 00:36:59,465
I'm asking

444
00:37:00,185 --> 00:37:01,985
for a place

445
00:37:02,545 --> 00:37:03,985
in your museum.

446
00:37:41,705 --> 00:37:42,985
Luke.

447
00:37:46,425 --> 00:37:47,865
Come here. Sit.

448
00:37:48,625 --> 00:37:50,385
-Why is Luke dressed like that?
-Sit.

449
00:37:55,345 --> 00:37:57,265
MARRY DAD

450
00:38:10,625 --> 00:38:11,505
Shang Zhitao,

451
00:38:13,465 --> 00:38:14,385
will you marry me?

452
00:38:32,745 --> 00:38:35,105
Tao, say yes already.

453
00:38:35,185 --> 00:38:37,185
You'd be crazy not to take the deal.

454
00:38:37,265 --> 00:38:38,665
You can claim half his assets first.

455
00:38:38,745 --> 00:38:39,585
That's right.

456
00:39:00,745 --> 00:39:01,905
I will.

457
00:39:41,785 --> 00:39:43,265
Don't be shy!

458
00:39:43,345 --> 00:39:44,745
So sweet!

459
00:39:48,345 --> 00:39:49,905
-Perfect!
-Great!

460
00:39:49,985 --> 00:39:51,305
Shang Zhitao!

461
00:39:54,105 --> 00:39:55,185
Be happy!

462
00:39:55,785 --> 00:39:56,785
Great!

463
00:40:04,465 --> 00:40:06,305
-Great.
-Yeah!

464
00:40:07,505 --> 00:40:09,985
Their love survived the bitter winter

465
00:40:10,505 --> 00:40:13,065
and finally welcomed the early spring.

466
00:40:14,105 --> 00:40:16,065
From there, through the blazing summer,

467
00:40:16,625 --> 00:40:20,105
they entered the brightest season
of their lives.

468
00:40:20,985 --> 00:40:23,065
And that warmth will never fade.

469
00:40:23,825 --> 00:40:24,665
May you,

470
00:40:25,185 --> 00:40:26,105
may I,

471
00:40:26,185 --> 00:40:27,385
may all of us

472
00:40:27,465 --> 00:40:28,905
be well.

473
00:40:42,865 --> 00:40:46,105
THE END

